  "panels": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Reading this dashboard",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 6
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "A robot's history over the time range, read from the store by each file's own measured clock. With **roboRIO log, else recording**, each stretch reads the roboRIO's own log where one was pulled and the pit's recording otherwise; **Pit recording** reads the recordings alone. Each panel is one entry: the band runs from each bucket's minimum to its maximum, the line is its mean, and zooming in narrows the buckets until every sample shows. The table lists the robot's sessions in the range; a row's link shows that session.\n\nThe two sources name one signal differently, so each panel has a box for each, filled exactly as each names the entry. A panel the server refuses shows only its status code: **400** means a box is empty or names something that is not a number, **404** means the robot or its store is unknown, **409** means two of the robot's logs, or recordings of two sessions, cover the same minutes, and **413** means the range holds more than 64 files: narrow it. A stretch no file covers is blank."
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "table",
      "title": "Sessions",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "yesoreyeram-infinity-datasource",
        "uid": "pit-recording"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 6,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 6
      },
      "description": "The robot's sessions in the range, from the store's catalog alone: each time is the session's own, with its basis.",
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "yesoreyeram-infinity-datasource",
            "uid": "pit-recording"
          },
          "type": "csv",
          "source": "url",
          "parser": "backend",
          "format": "table",
          "url": "/data/sessions",
          "url_options": {
            "method": "GET",
            "data": "",
            "params": [
              {
                "key": "robot",
                "value": "$robot"
              },
              {
                "key": "start_utc",
                "value": "${__from:date:iso}"
              },
              {
                "key": "end_utc",
                "value": "${__to:date:iso}"
              }
            ]
          },
          "csv_options": {
            "comment": "#"
          },
          "columns": [
            {
              "selector": "started_at",
              "text": "started_at",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "selector": "ended_at",
              "text": "ended_at",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "selector": "time_basis",
              "text": "time_basis",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "selector": "event",
              "text": "event",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "selector": "match_type",
              "text": "match_type",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "selector": "match_number",
              "text": "match_number",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "selector": "sources",
              "text": "sources",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "selector": "files",
              "text": "files",
              "type": "number"
            },
            {
              "selector": "recording",
              "text": "recording",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "selector": "start_ms",
              "text": "start_ms",
              "type": "number"
            },
            {
              "selector": "end_ms",
              "text": "end_ms",
              "type": "number"
            },
            {
              "selector": "session_id",
              "text": "session_id",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "links": [
            {
              "title": "Show this session",
              "url": "/d/wpilog-pit-history?${__all_variables}&from=${__data.fields.start_ms}&to=${__data.fields.end_ms}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "start_ms"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "custom.hidden",
                "value": true
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "end_ms"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "custom.hidden",
                "value": true
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "options": {
        "showHeader": true
      }
    },
